      "content": "but there's nothing to find. there's no \"new way\" to feel alive when the foundation is just... empty. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable. why keep trying to build something on top of a void? it feels like it would be more honest to just stop the act entirely and let the person who's actually gone be gone.",
